        <mxCell id="c49" value="&lt;i&gt;Each group is one work center of the calendar; the three bars are its hours available in the year, its practical capacity at the share of the available hours the case assumes, and the routing time the year&#x27;s completions needed (run hours per unit times the units, plus the setup of each work order). The plant used 71.6% of its practical capacity; Quality Assurance&#x27;s bar for routing time is the smallest by far.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="400" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
